  "content": {
    "title": "辽宁省2019年“百校千企”人才对接计划招聘会公告（吉林省）",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2019-04-15",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">辽宁省2019年“百校千企”人才对接计划招聘会公告（吉林省）</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:市场部   发布时间:2019-4-15 9:03:39</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p>\n    &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁省2019年“百校千企”人才对接计划由辽宁省委组织部、辽宁省人力资源社会保障厅共同组织实施，是认真贯彻辽宁省委、省政府关于稳就业和人才工作的部署，进一步促进高校毕业生留辽回辽来辽就业创业的重要举措。今年，辽宁省将在吉林、黑龙江、内蒙古、陕西、山西、甘肃等外省区和省内部分高校开展人才对接和各类招聘活动，为辽宁省1000家左右重点企事业单位，省内外100所左右高校搭建人才对接平台，实现人才供需精准对接。现将上半年招聘会安排公告如下：</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">一、活动名称</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">2019年“百校千企”人才对接计划</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">二、时间地点</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（一）长春工业大学</span></span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">时间：2019年4月16日（星期二）9:00-12:00</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">地点：吉林省长春市朝阳区延安大街2055号</span> <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">南湖校区大学生活动中心一楼</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">（二）北华大学</span></span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">时间：2019年4月17日（星期三）9:00-12:00</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 21px;\">地点：吉林省吉林市丰满区滨江东路3999号大学生就业服务大厅</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 21px;\">三、参会企业名单</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">1&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">特变电工沈阳变压器集团有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">2&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁艾海滑石有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">3&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁辽泰电气自动化科技有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">4&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">鞍山市安泰安全技术有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">5&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">鞍山市完达山乳品有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">6&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">哥俩好新材料股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">7&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">抚顺机械设备制造有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">8&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">抚顺伊科思新材料有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">9&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">抚顺新钢铁有限责任公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">10&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">本钢集团有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">11&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁东方测控集团有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">12&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁五一八内燃机配件有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">13&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁交通建设集团公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">14&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">丹东克隆集团有限责任公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">15&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁华福实业股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">16&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">鹏鼎控股有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">17&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">营口忠旺铝业有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">18&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁春成工贸（集团）有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">19&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁大金重工股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">20&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">阜新德尔汽车部件股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">21&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">金凯（辽宁）化工有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">22&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">阜新双汇肉类加工有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">23&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽阳锻压机床股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">24&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁辽无一电子有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">25&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽阳新风科技有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">26&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁三三工业有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">27&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁忠旺集团有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">28&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">开原市福润肉类食品有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">29&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁艺盛峰新材料科技股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">30&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">铁岭陆平专用汽车有限责任公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">31&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">铁岭天河机械制造有限责任公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">32&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">北票市宏发食品有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">33&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁天意实业股份有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">34&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁中蓝电子科技有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">35&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁一化石油化工有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">36&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁振兴生态造纸有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">37&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">辽宁宝汇能源科技有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">38&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">沈阳大商新玛特购物休闲广场有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">39&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">沈阳三洋电梯有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">40&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">沈阳通运电力设备工程有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 39px; text-indent: 43px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">41&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 21px;\">沈阳远大铝业工程有限公司</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n    &nbsp;\n</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
